WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.640
With foundations in place we can analyze
the 10 core ethical dimensions unique

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.640
to machine learning. The first category is
control and privacy.

3
00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.500
Researchers must maintain meaningful human
agency over every AI driven

4
00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:17.380
decision. This pairs with data governance,
requiring committees to identify

5
00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:22.104
risks of unauthorized secondary use within
massive sensitive data sets.
